<title>UK: LME - WAREHOUSE STOCK MOVEMENTS.</title>
<headline>LME - WAREHOUSE STOCK MOVEMENTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 07 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 800, tin up 145, lead down 50, zinc down 25, aluminium down 1400, nickel up 294, aluminium alloy unchanged</p>
